% ============================================================================
% monarch-life-cycle.query.adj — worked recall over the monarch life-cycle
% library.
% ============================================================================
% The shape a learner (or an LLM) produces to ANSWER "what position is this
% stage in the life cycle?" (direct) or "which stage comes first/second/
% etc.?" (reverse) — it states no fact of its own — it only `import`s the
% grounded table and asks binding queries.
% ============================================================================

import "monarch-life-cycle.adj"

? monarch_life_stage(pupa, $N)    % expect 3 (direct: what position is the pupa/chrysalis stage?)
? monarch_life_stage($S, 1)       % expect egg (reverse: which stage comes first?)
? monarch_life_stage(nymph, $N)   % expect abstain -- "nymph" is not one of the monarch's four stages
